      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Provide route and departure deadline.\n2. Let participant find the warning.\n3. Simulate verification only after they request it.\n4. Run: active roadworks / absent roadworks / no response.\n5. Ask participant to explain status and next action.\n\nObserve comprehension, hesitation, unsafe assumptions, and rerouting attempts.",
